config LAYMAP_LAYER_REPORT
    bool "Broadcast the active ZMK layer to the host over raw HID (laymap)"
    depends on RAW_HID
    help
      Subscribe to layer state changes and send a raw-HID report to the host
      on every change, so the laymap desktop overlay can display the active
      layer. Requires the zmk-raw-hid module (CONFIG_RAW_HID).

      Report framing (inside the CONFIG_RAW_HID_REPORT_SIZE-byte payload):
        byte 0   : 0x4C ('L') message type
        byte 1   : highest active layer index (0 = base)
        bytes 2-5: active-layer bitmask, u32 little-endian
        rest     : zero
